hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16031","Al-Walid ibn Muslim narrated to us, he said, I heard Yazid ibn Abi Maryam saying, Abayah ibn Rafi ibn Khadij met me while I was going to the mosque to Friday on foot, and he was riding, he said, receive glad tidings, for I heard Abu Abs saying, the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Whose feet become dusty in the path of Allah, mighty and majestic, Allah, mighty and majestic, forbids them to the Fire."
